# docs/compiler/codegen.md §3 step 2, §13, §16: the browser's containers hold only the services the
# client roots reach. A service only server code injects (the gateway bound for every environment), and
# a service nothing injects, are not in any client file, even though nothing marks them server-only.
client contains export class Counter
client contains get Counter()
client lacks LocalGateway
client lacks RealGateway
client lacks local-gateway-literal
client lacks real-gateway-literal
client lacks Unused
client lacks unused-service-literal
client lacks get Gateway()
server contains export class PayApi
